WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.495
Welcome to CuidaJuntos, the free app to care for a loved one together.

2
00:00:05.645 --> 00:00:11.854
Your family shares one care circle: medicines, appointments, tasks and chat, always in sync.

3
00:00:12.004 --> 00:00:15.973
Reminders and family alerts make sure no dose is forgotten.

4
00:00:16.123 --> 00:00:21.202
Keep a health log, create a report for the doctor, and carry an emergency card.

5
00:00:21.352 --> 00:00:26.537
A friendly companion pet cheers you on, and help is one tap away. Let's start!
